<title>UK: LME people - MG expands Tokyo operations.</title>
<headline>LME people - MG expands Tokyo operations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Metal Exchange (LME) ring-dealing company Metallgesellschaft (MG) Ltd said on Friday it is expanding its existing business in Tokyo, Japan.</p>
<p>&quot;MG Ltd is pleased to announce the appointments of Mr K. Sugimoto as General Manager and Mr T.T.C. Cheng as Manager of its metal trading operations in Japan,&quot; MG said in a news release.</p>
<p>MG currently has an office in Tokyo, so these appointments represent an expansion. Sugimoto and Cheng previously worked with Lehman Brothers in Japan.</p>
<p>&quot;We are growing our business there...and expanding our LME operations in Tokyo,&quot; Mike Hutchinson, MG Managing Director in London, said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
